SUMMARY:Rieke Art Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Annual Rieke Art Fair! 🎨 Experience a day of creativity and community in the heart of SW Portland. This free\, family-friendly event features: \n\n\nShop Local: Dozens of artists selling jewelry\, ceramics\, paintings\, and apparel. \n\n\nGet Creative: Face painting\, an art scavenger hunt\, and hands-on activities. \n\n\nEnjoy the Vibes: Live music and a curated student art exhibit. \n\n\nRunning alongside the Hillsdale Farmers’ Market\, it’s the perfect way to support our local public school while enjoying the best of the neighborhood. See you there! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
